OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIs an 'AI war' complicating your
OL,4,Ajob search?
OL,5,
OL,6,FI have lost track of the number of
OL,7,Fpeople who have told me they have
OL,8,Fapplied for hundreds of jobs, only to
OL,9,Fbe met with rejection after rejection.
OL,11,FOften, they said it felt like a human
OL,12,Fhad not even looked at their
OL,13,Fapplications.
OL,15,FThere are lots of different types of
OL,16,Frecruitment tools. Some match
OL,17,Fcandidates to jobs, others grade and
OL,18,Fscreen CVs. Employers use them to save
OL,19,Ftime sifting through applications, but
OL,20,Fthere are growing concerns that these
OL,21,Ftools could be biased.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
